{"product_id":"the-power-of-geography-ten-maps-that-reveal-the-future-of-our-world","title":"The Power of Geography: Ten Maps That Reveal the Future of Our World","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"67\" data-end=\"283\"\u003eThe world is shaped by borders, mountains, rivers, deserts, and oceans—and Tim Marshall is here to prove that geography isn’t just the stuff of school atlases, it’s the secret script running beneath every headline.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"285\" data-end=\"759\"\u003eIn The Power of Geography: Ten Maps That Reveal the Future of Our World, Marshall (author of the global bestseller Prisoners of Geography) takes us on a guided tour of the places where tomorrow’s power struggles, alliances, and rivalries are being written. From Australia’s strategic role in the Pacific to the growing influence of space itself, these ten maps don’t just explain the present—they forecast the battles, breakthroughs, and backroom deals shaping the future.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"1059\"\u003eThink of it as the ultimate crystal ball, except instead of vague prophecies, you get sharp analysis grounded in terrain, trade, and tectonics. If you want to understand why leaders make the decisions they do—and what the world might look like in a decade—this is the book you need on your shelf.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1190\"\u003ePerfect for news junkies, history buffs, and anyone who’s ever squinted at a map and wondered, “So what does this really mean?”\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1317\"\u003eProduct details\u003cbr data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1210\"\u003eAuthor : Tim Marshall\u003cbr data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1232\"\u003eFormat : Paperback\u003cbr data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1251\"\u003ePages : 272\u003cbr data-start=\"1260\" data-end=\"1263\"\u003eISBN : 9781783965376\u003cbr data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1284\"\u003eDimensions : 19.8 x 12.9 x 2.2 cm\u003c\/p\u003e","